  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output A.1. Enhanced decent work statistics using innovative sources and statistical standards</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The Government of Zimbabwe through the Zimbabwe Statistical Agency (ZMISTAT) has conducted and reported on six (6) Quarterly Labour Force Surveys (QLFS) incorporating the 20th ICLS Resolution on work relationships.
a. The QLFS have disseminated throughout 2022-2023
b. The Zimbabwe Statistical Agency (ZIMSTAT) has also shared
the microdata with ILO STAT.
 1. The ILO provided technical and advisory support towards the updating of the survey questionnaire, data analysis and report outline as part of the preparations for the Quarterly Labour Force Surveys.
a. The ILO provided technical and advisory services towards the sensitisation and orientation for the ZIMSTAT technical team on the 20th ICLS Resolution.</narrative>
   </description>
